# Normalise to LF in the repository regardless of the checkout platform.
#
# Developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which would otherwise rewrite
# line endings per-platform and make every file — including the frozen caption
# fixtures — show as wholly modified on a fresh clone. The parsers fold \r\n and
# bare \r to \n themselves (parse/base.py), so nothing depends on which ending
# reaches the working copy.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Captured payloads, replayed verbatim forever. Diffing them is noise, and
# nothing here should ever "fix" their line endings in place.
tests/fixtures/** -diff
